
way-displays 2.0.0 has changed the cfg.yaml schema
This is a backwards compatible change.
See https://github.com/alex-courtis/way-displays/wiki/Version-2.0.0-Changes

Migrated NAME_DESC arrays to keyed maps:
  SCALE:
  MODE:
  TRANSFORM:
  DISABLED:
Migrated LAPTOP_DISPLAY_PREFIX to lid closed condition:
  DISABLED:
    '!^lappy':
      IF:
      - LID: CLOSED

Please upgrade your cfg.yaml:
  way-displays --write
